{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nI arrived in Koblenz yesterday, though the journey from Kassel was tedious enough. I dined with the Beers, then took a coach to Marburg, where I called briefly on Suabedissen. The heat was oppressive, and I was glad to spend the afternoon in Wetzlar with Schulz’s family. His kindness in showing me the town this morning, and seeing me onto the 10 a.m. mail coach, was a welcome respite from the dust and noise of travel.\n\nI have taken a bath, which has done me good. The Rhine here is grand, but I confess the landscape does not stir the spirit quite as the city does. I miss the quiet of our home and the presence of the boys. I hope this letter finds you and the children well. Do not worry too much about my pace; I am taking things as they come.\n\nYour affectionate,\nGeorg"}}],"created":1795080644,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":197,"prompt_tokens":953,"total_tokens":1150,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-1aQX86d1urmWtPsgsSXqKd3sWznGpYen","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":953,"prompt_ms":917.601,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.9628551941238195,"prompt_per_second":1038.5777696406174,"predicted_n":197,"predicted_ms":4742.958,"predicted_per_token_ms":24.198765306122446,"predicted_per_second":41.3244224384867}}